OL,3,GNEWSAEx-counter terror cop fined for
OL,4,Asocial media posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former counter terrorism officer has
OL,7,Fbeen fined for making threatening
OL,8,Fcomments online.
OL,10,FRobert Douglas, 61, posted remarks
OL,11,Fabout Muslims and asylum seekers on a
OL,12,FFacebook page.
OL,14,FAt York Magistrates Court on Monday,
OL,15,FDouglas admitted sending a threatening
OL,16,Fmessage.
OL,18,FSentencing Douglas, of Church View in
OL,19,FBrompton, near Northallerton, Linda
OL,20,FGoddard, chair of the magistrates'
OL,21,Fbench, said the comments were "clearly
OL,22,Fconsidered in the language used".
